\par 
\par INTRODUCING THE CAESAR III EDITOR
\par 
\par Thank you for taking the time to download the Caesar III Editor. We look forward to playing your maps! 
\par 
\par ========================================================================= 
\par 
\par USING THE CAESAR III EDITOR
\par 
\par The instructions that follow are adapted almost verbatim from the online help. Access this information from the Editor\rquote s Help menu, or from this file, whichever you find easier to use.
\par 
